    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Five years ago, on December 15, 2017, His Highness the Aga Khan inaugurated the AKU's Centre for Innovation in Medical Education in Pakistan. In the last few years, CIME has fast acquired the reputation of being the most advanced healthcare simulation centre in Pakistan and East Africa, and the first in South Asia to be accredited by the Society for Simulation in Healthcare (SSH).",
